@baseUrl = https://localhost:5001/api/v1
@providerToken = replace-with-provider-access-token
@clientToken = replace-with-client-access-token
@estimateId = 1
@commandId = 1
@paypalTransactionId = replace-with-completed-paypal-transaction-id

### Create an invoice from an estimate with both persisted signatures (performer)
POST {{baseUrl}}/invoices/from-estimate/{{estimateId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{providerToken}}

### Read its frozen lines, balance and receipt history (either party)
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices/{{commandId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

### Record an offline receipt (performer); replay the exact body to test idempotence
POST {{baseUrl}}/invoices/{{commandId}}/payments/offline
Authorization: Bearer {{providerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reference": "bank-transfer-2026-001",
  "amount": 30.00,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "receivedAtUtc": "2026-10-19T12:00:00Z"
}

### Verify an already captured PayPal transaction (either party); not a checkout token
POST {{baseUrl}}/invoices/{{commandId}}/payments/paypal
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionId": "{{paypalTransactionId}}"
}

### Missing invoice -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices/999999999
Authorization: Bearer {{providerToken}}

### A client cannot attest an offline receipt -> 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/invoices/{{commandId}}/payments/offline
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reference": "not-authorized",
  "amount": 30.00,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "receivedAtUtc": "2026-10-19T12:00:00Z"
}
